+// Guest thread only (every tick runs there). Cleared at the top of every tick, set only when a
+// tick leaves owed blocks behind an in-flight mix; the mix worker always finishes, so a scheduler
+// loop that waits on it always makes progress.
+bool g_axYieldPending = false;
